# Where the multiplayer server lives. Leave unset in development: the client
# uses the page's host on port 2567. Set it for deployments, e.g. a server
# behind a reverse proxy on its own domain.
# VITE_SERVER_URL=https://play.example.com

# Voice calls use WebRTC. The game server hands the browser its STUN/TURN
# servers (GET /api/ice); set TURN_HOST and TURN_SECRET on the server to add a
# TURN relay for people behind strict networks. Nothing to set here.
